-   - **Normalized:** $p = \frac{\exp(E)}{2\pi\sqrt{\det(\Sigma)}}$
-   - **Unnormalized:** $p = \exp(E)$
-   - **Conic:** $p = \exp(E) \cdot R$, where $R$ is the rescale factor (`conic_and_rescale.w`).
