-   - **Unnormalized Variant:**
-     $$ \frac{dp}{d\_cov} = 0.5 p \left( \Sigma^{-1} \Delta \Delta^T \Sigma^{-1} \right) $$
-   - **Conic Variant:**
-     $$ \frac{dp}{d\_cov} = 0.5 p \left( C \Delta \Delta^T C \right) $$
